rd difference approximation formula\n\n$$\n{q}^{′}(t)≈\\frac{q(t)-q(t-h)}{h},\n$$\n\n \nat the time $t=2.$ We choose the step size $h$ to be as small as possible, in this case $h=1.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{q}^{′}(2) & ≈\\frac{q(2)-q(2-1)}{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{q(2)-q(1)}{1} \\\\  & =186-192 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the rate of change of the volume is $-6$ liters per hour." 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336242 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336243 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336244 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336245 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336246 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1041 "selection" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1104 #edb/ref 17592186336246 13194139535185 true] [17592186336241 1110 #uuid "1b8d5130-0515-5454-8e63-1391311683e0" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336242 1034 "$-4$ liters per hour" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535185 true] [17592186336242 1111 #uuid "e941df27-1d0f-554a-8daf-8c62f00a0b95" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336243 1034 "$5$ liters per hour" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535185 true] [17592186336243 1111 #uuid "75023b24-2f49-5a3e-8bc6-053d983b628c" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336244 1034 "$4$ liters per hour" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535185 true] [17592186336244 1111 #uuid "d779623d-6921-5907-a3a1-16f4f70dcf50" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336245 1034 "$6$ liters per hour" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535185 true] [17592186336245 1111 #uuid "6da3c470-8ff4-526b-81e8-19b2d9dd2036" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336246 1034 "$-6$ liters per hour" 13194139535185 true] [17592186336246 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454